SUMMARY:Celebrating 60 Years of Star Trek - A Fan Event from the Brooklyn SciFi Film Festival
DESCRIPTION:The Brooklyn SciFi Film Festival and St. Mark’s Comics present a family-friendly program of six Star Trek-inspired fan films with Trek-themed entertainment hosted at bkOne’s Tom Kane Theatre in Industry City\, Sunset Park\, Brooklyn on Saturday\, October 10th\, from 1pm to 4pm. With special musical performances\, films\, and life-size Star Trek character pop-ups for photos. St. Mark’s Comics joins the event\, showcasing comics and collectibles. Show up in full Star Trek Cosplay costume for free entry! Or use promo code StarTrek60 to save 15% on Eventbrite. \nLocation: Tom Kane Theatre\, Industry City Building 5\nAddress: 51 35th St Bldg 5\, Brooklyn\, NY \nPromocode: StarTrek60 to Save 15% on all Brooklyn SciFi Festival events on Eventbrite. \nLink to Tickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/star-trek-fan-film-event-brooklyn-scifi-film-festival-tickets-2000514915966
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/celebrating-60-years-of-star-trek-a-fan-event-from-the-brooklyn-scifi-film-festival/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://industrycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/startrek-banner2.jpg
END:VEVENT
