SUMMARY:Oyster Festival
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of oysters\, Japanese drinks\, food\, and live music at Japan Village! Enjoy oysters paired with Suntory drinks\, including Japanese beer and refreshing highballs. Enjoy live DJ music throughout the afternoon. \nIn case of rain\, the event will be moved indoors to the Loft on the second floor of Japan Village. \n📅 October 10\, 2026\n⏰ 2–7 PM\n📍 Japan Village Courtyard\n🎟️ FREE EVENT \nAdmission is free\, but RSVPs are encouraged so we can get an idea of how many guests to expect.
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/oyster-festival/
