SUMMARY:Recycled Plates: An Introduction to Intaglio Etching
DESCRIPTION:This workshop introduces participants to intaglio printmaking through the use of recycled Tetrapak cartons as printing plates. Participants will learn how to incise designs into the plates and create small editions of prints using a small 3D tabletop etching press. This is a great introduction to printing with Tetra Pak! \nMaterials Included
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/recycled-plates-an-introduction-to-intaglio-etching/
CATEGORIES:Art
