SUMMARY:A Haunting in Industry City
DESCRIPTION:A Haunting in Industry City is an art market centered around the horror genre. This October\, we’ll have 20 vendors selling their wares\, everything from art to apparel to jewelry to trinkets. All types of horror themed handmade goods will be available! \nAttendees can also look forward to a costume contest and a raffle for a basket of delightfully horrible prizes! We’re going to have a bit of everything\, so make sure to RSVP and stop by! \nThe first 50 RSVPs to arrive will be given a Haunting zine that includes peek a boo bingo and a spooky little photo card!
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/a-haunting-in-industry-city/
