SUMMARY:Guided Brewery Tour and Sake Tasting
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Brooklyn Kura! Join us for a tour of our state-of-the-art sake brewery in Industry City\, Brooklyn. See first hand how we turn rice and water into delicious Brooklyn-made premium craft sake. Led by our expert brewery staff\, this experience will walk you through our production facility and allow you to take in the sights\, sounds and delicious smells of New York’s premier sake brewery.
