SUMMARY:Monoprinting with Gelli Plates
DESCRIPTION:This workshop will introduce adults to the possibilities of monoprinting with Gelli plates. Participants will explore techniques including layering transparent colors\, creating textures\, and building compositions through repetition and variation. This process-based workshop welcomes beginners and offers experienced artists an opportunity to expand their printmaking practice through experimentation and intuitive image-making with accessible gelli printing. These prints can stand alone or be used for further printing with block printing.. \nMaterials Included
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/monoprinting-with-gelli-plates/
CATEGORIES:Workshops
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://industrycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Lindsey_Jones_monoy.png
END:VEVENT
