SUMMARY:Headshot Refresh Event
DESCRIPTION:Headshot Refresh Day with Randi Rosenblum Photo \nThursday\, October 22 | 9 a.m.–5 p.m.\n254 36th Street\, Industry City\, Brooklyn \nDoes your current headshot photo still look like you? If it’s from a different job\, a different haircut\, or a different decade\, fall is the perfect time for an update. \n$275 (regularly $350) \n40-minute session\n2 outfits\n2 retouched favorites \nWant to look camera-ready? Add on-site hair and makeup with Gloss Brooklyn: blowouts $65\, makeup $135. \nQuestions? Email info@randirosenblumphoto.com or call 917-676-0184.
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/headshot-refresh-event/
