SUMMARY:Sake Tasting Event: Sake and Cheese Pairing Class and Brewery Tour
DESCRIPTION:Step away from that bottle of vino and join us to sample the absolute best beverage to pair with cheese – We are talking about sake! If you haven’t yet tried pairing craft sake and premium cheese\, you are in for a revelation. We’ll explore a wide range of flavors and textures… and together\, we’ll discover the most exciting combinations of sake styles and cheeses from around the world. The experience is fun\, interactive and absolutely delicious! Join us at Brooklyn Kura to learn about sake where sake is made! \nWhat’s included: \nA welcome sake to get you started!\nA brief intro to sake and cheese basics.\nGuided Tasting of 5 Japanese craft sakes from different regions paired to perfection with 5 outstanding cheese varieties.\nExploration of sake and cheese production styles and terrior.\nEnjoy some nibbles and spreads on your cheese board that will take the pairing over the top.\nHandouts so you can bring your newfound sake and cheese knowledge home\nFinish with a Guided tour through our new Sake Brewery
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/sake-and-cheese-pairing-class-and-brewery-tour/2026-10-24/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://industrycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Screen-Shot-2026-03-19-at-2.56.11-PM.jpg
END:VEVENT
