UID:10052545-1792854000-1792864800@industrycity.com
SUMMARY:Family Program: Handmade Stationery Block Printing
DESCRIPTION:In this hands-on family workshop\, participants will explore the fundamentals of relief printmaking while creating a personalized family stationery set. Families will learn simple stamping and printing techniques\, carve their own designs\, and experiment with everyday materials like vegetables and found objects to make unique prints. A selection of pre-carved blocks will also be available\, allowing participants to combine personal designs with existing imagery and explore the possibilities of shared printmaking tools. \nMaterials Included\nAdults & Children 6+
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/family-program-handmade-stationery-block-printing/
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://industrycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Block-Printing.jpg
END:VEVENT
