UID:10052524-1792868400-1792890000@industrycity.com
SUMMARY:Rocky Horror Picture Show
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to do the Time Warp again! Join brooklynONE productions for our Annual Rocky Horror Picture Show Shadow Cast Event on October 24 at Industry City! \nThis year\, we’re paying tribute to the legendary Tim Curry with a special video celebration honoring his unforgettable career and the iconic performance that made Dr. Frank-N-Furter a cultural phenomenon. \nOur fabulous bkONE shadow cast will bring the film to life with a wildly interactive performance. Shout\, dance\, use your props\, and join the madness! Whether you’re a seasoned fan or a Rocky Horror “virgin\,” everyone is welcome. \nAdmission to the shadow-cast screening is completely FREE\, because Rocky Horror is always better with a packed house. \nCome dressed as your best Frank-N-Furter and enter our Frank-N-Furter Look-Alike Contest for just $5. Strut\, pose\, perform\, and let the audience decide who truly deserves \nGet ready to do the Time Warp again! Join brooklynONE productions for our Annual Rocky Horror Picture Show Shadow Cast Event on October 24 at Industry City! \nThis year\, we’re paying tribute to the legendary Tim Curry with a special video celebration honoring his unforgettable career and the iconic performance that made Dr. Frank-N-Furter a cultural phenomenon. \nOur fabulous bkONE shadow cast will bring the film to life with a wildly interactive performance. Shout\, dance\, use your props\, and experience the madness alongside a packed house of Rocky Horror fans. Whether you’re a seasoned fan or a Rocky Horror “virgin\,” everyone is invited! \nAdmission to the shadow-cast screening is completely FREE\, because Rocky Horror is always better with a packed house. \nCome dressed as your best Frank-N-Furter and enter our Frank-N-Furter Look-Alike Contest for just $5. Strut\, pose\, perform\, and let the audience decide who truly deserves the crown! \nTACO MIX will be serving food all night\, so come hungry and fuel up for the madness. \nWhen the credits roll\, don’t go home. The night transforms into our ticketed Time Warp After Dark DJ Party\, with DJ Dmitri keeping the dance floor moving late into the night. Come in costume\, grab a drink\, and keep doing the Time Warp with us! \nWHEN\nSaturday\, October 24\nScreening: 8:00 PM\nTime Warp After Dark: Immediately following the film \nWHERE\nIndustry City\nBrooklyn\, New York \nADMISSION \n* Shadow-cast screening: FREE\n* Frank-N-Furter Look-Alike Contest entry: $5\n* Time Warp After Dark DJ Party: Separate ticket required\n* Prop bags: Available for purchase\n* Food by TACO MIX: Available for purchase all night \nCome in costume\, grab a prop bag and some tacos\, and let the bkONE shadow cast guide you through a night dedicated to Rocky Horror\, Tim Curry\, and absolute pleasure. \nWe’re already trembling with antici…pation!
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/rocky-horror-picture-show/
CATEGORIES:Live Events,Nightlife
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://industrycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/rocky.png
END:VEVENT
